        <source>Custom Semantic Part styling</source>
        <target state="translated">自訂語義結構的樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticRootDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Root element with border thickness, visual mode and expansion state that control the overall appearance of the panel</source>
        <target state="translated">根元素，包含邊框厚度、視覺模式、展開狀態等控制面板整體外觀的樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticTitleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Title element with layout, foreground color and typography styles for the header text</source>
        <target state="translated">標題元素，包含佈局、前景色、排版等標題文字的樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SizeDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Ant Design supports a default Expander size as well as a large and small size. If a large or small Expander is desired, set the size property to either large or small respectively. Omit the size property for a Expander with the default size.</source>
        <target state="translated">Ant Design 支持默認、大號和小號三種 Expander 尺寸。需要大號或小號時分別設置 size 屬性；省略 size 屬性時使用默認尺寸。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
